# "Spend this mana only to cast a Mount spell" (CR 106.6): the Ranch's one mana of any color ({W} here) is the only mana
# in the pool, so `! Hinterland Sanctifier` - a one-mana white creature spell that is no Mount, which the white mana
# would pay for if it could - is refused. The positive control is the same mana and pool paying the {W} of a Bulwark Ox
# (a Mount, {1}{W}), the {1} coming from a Mox Jet. The Ox enters the battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Bucolic Ranch
Mox Jet
Hinterland Sanctifier
Bulwark Ox
Island x3
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Bucolic Ranch.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Bucolic Ranch.Activate(Ability: any color; Color: White)
